OL,4,Agirl video to appeal sentences
OL,5,
OL,6,FNadjedzha Belova, 20, was ordered to
OL,7,Fcomplete 180 hours of unpaid work after
OL,8,Fadmitting assaulting another girl in
OL,9,Fthe group to her injury.
OL,11,FA video of the child holding the
OL,12,Fweapons was highlighted at the time by
OL,13,FElon Musk, who criticised her arrest
OL,14,Ffor "trying to defend herself".
